# AICL Example: Range
# AX sub-language — compiles to real code.

Goal:
max-min

Layer:
Core

Behavior Range
    Input: array
    Output: range_val
    Action:
        minimum = array[0]
        maximum = array[0]
        for i in range(1, len(array)):
            if array[i] < minimum:
                minimum = array[i]
            if array[i] > maximum:
                maximum = array[i]
        return maximum - minimum
